    Events copy for the details, the editor, the 13-month date field, the repeat, alert and calendar
    pickers, the span and conflict dialogs, deletes and the pending-change toasts (task D6):
    docs/EVENTS.md §2.19, verbatim, with the catalogue ids (dots become underscores). Strings shared
    with the Calendar (event_allDay, event_timeRange, event_tentative, event_canceled,
